        ('/**\n     * Adds geospatial members.\n     * \n     * @param entries - objects\n     * @return number of elements added to the sorted set, \n     * not including elements already existing for which \n     * the score was updated\n     */', '/**\n     * 批量添加地理空间成员。\n     * \n     * @param entries 地理空间条目\n     * @return 新增元素数量\n     * 不含已存在且仅更新分数的元素；\n     * 已存在成员的分数被更新时不计入新增数。\n     */'),
