        ("/**\n     * Adds geospatial members only if it's already exists.\n     * <p>\n     * Requires <b>Redis 6.2.0 and higher.</b>\n     *\n     * @param entries - objects\n     * @return number of elements added to the sorted set\n     */", '/**\n     * 批量：仅当成员已存在时更新坐标。\n     * <p>\n     * Requires <b>Redis 6.2.0 and higher.</b>\n     *\n     * @param entries 地理空间条目\n     * @return 新增元素数量\n     */'),
